# Don't Forget the Antidote (outlands 192), the quest's own var at the completion: accepted, DontForgetAntidoteVar 1,
# the Vial of Desert Venom and Quest[5][192]Prog 1 (GMs). Edigey: the vial, 4; finished (the var 1): the var 0, the vial
# taken, the Desert Hunter title, the Dotanuki, ITEM_OBTAINED, the raw player:completeQuest,
# San d'Oria and Bastok fame +5. The raw completeQuest does no cleanup: Quest[5][192]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's
# cleanup would clear it).
char zone=Rabao pos=-34.7,0,-37.9 job=SAM lvl=75
quest Outlands.DontForgetTheAntidote accepted
charvar DontForgetAntidoteVar 1
item VialOfDesertVenom
charvar Quest[5][192]Prog 1             # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trade Edigey VialOfDesertVenom x1       # 4
finish                                  # the first time: the Dotanuki; completed, Prog kept; fame
trigger Edigey                          # default turn: 50
finish
trigger Edigey                          # script, completed: 5
finish
